### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect cluster health and allocation explanations for unassigned primary shards. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
A missing data node, unavailable storage or allocation constraints.

### Fix
Restore the affected node/storage or correct allocation constraints; preserve index data and recovery options.

### Verify
All primary shards are assigned and cluster health leaves red. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
